    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογ-άδην</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογάς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>picked</i>, of troops, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> mostly of
			stones for building, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰργάζοντο λ. φέροντες
				λίθους καὶ ξυνετίθεσαν ὡς ἕκαστόν τι ξυμβαίνοι</span>
			bringing the stones <i>as they picked them out</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
